<title>UK: Eurobonds - Expected new issues.</title>
<headline>Eurobonds - Expected new issues.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a summary of expected major new issues in the international primary debt market.</p>
<p>The list was compiled from information provided by borrowers, banks mandated to lead manage the issues and other primary market sources. All terms and conditions are indicative.</p>
<p>Details of upcoming bond issues can be telephoned into the London newsroom on +44 171 542 7658</p>
<p>(OFFICIAL indicates confirmed by borrower)</p>
<p>* * * DOLLARS * * *</p>
<p>+ JAPAN HIGHWAY, considering $500 million 10-year bond</p>
<p>* * * FRANCS * * *</p>
<p>+ Several Japanese names said to be eyeing sector, including government-guaranteed entities</p>
<p>* * * GUILDERS * * *</p>
<p>+ FRANKFURT HYPO, seen eyeing pfandbrief issue</p>
<p>* * * MARKS * * *</p>
<p>+ GERMAN LANDER, said to be planning third Lander jumbo deal</p>
